{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：14:30 2026-10-04 HKT</p>\n\n<p>忠誠拍賣行發言人表示，深水埗福榮街一個高層唐樓業主盤，面積693方呎，2房間隔，僅以85萬元「車位價」開拍，較銀行估價250萬低165萬元或66%，呎價僅約1227元，將於本周三（7日）拍賣。</p>\n<h2>深水埗福榮街唐樓高層業主盤：</h2>\n<img alt=\"深水埗福榮街一個高層唐樓業主盤，面積693方呎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8db32d072bbcd568bd2b89860db55461/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_22_49_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單位採2房間隔，僅以85萬元「車位價」開拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c63a5dfb03d1c0096e05ed80aff6883/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_22_50_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17f332c4185b6f12069d347d2747f796/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_22_50.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3344afea3e64058ac4db10df6f93828/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_22_51.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c436434eefe69527d13a6e3b04cf718/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_22_49.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37b28f76b2065779fcc1e4c29599dbee/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_22_49_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>該發言人續指，上遺單位由逆權管有人持有，屬無契物業，原業主及其相關遺產承辦人相繼離世，佔用人本來是租客，長時間在此默默居住，再透過申請「逆權佔有」成為合法業主，惟他現時年紀老邁，無力再走樓梯上落，因此決定放售。</p>\n<h2>將軍澳CAPRI 雙號洋房銀主盤：</h2>\n<img alt=\"將軍澳CAPRI 雙號洋房銀主盤，面積2445方呎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37f05ef1a362a97b899c9f3e197cb3b7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_23_16.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單位屬銀主盤，開價4800萬元連兩個車位推拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c2b048b7aedea176926fe18d1d85b3c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_23_18.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c224c24d082b63e2fbd9a0b2a533935e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_23_17_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c907e2121ecaa2b5603dfab9cd23b047/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_23_17_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洋房附連915方呎天台及1,057方呎花園。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41ca0d1b86c07835014e93553efd2f0f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_23_18_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca4f6078519a2e8ce02383e567ad48e4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_23_17.jpeg\"/>\n<p>環亞拍賣行發言人表示，將軍澳CAPRI 雙號洋房，面積2445方呎，附連915方呎天台及1,057方呎花園，單位屬銀主盤，開價4800萬元連兩個車位推拍，較銀行估價的5,500萬低700萬元或約13%，呎價約19,632元，將於下周二（13日）進行拍賣，同場共有約59項物業可供競投。</p>\n<h2>觀塘冠天閣中低層A室：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/439d393efe77ce0875f86e7eddaf5e1c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_23_30_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea89e0cd989ab10b5b394ff9dd29b9c3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_23_30.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/506c99bf25c167b50f8da59191a9823a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_23_31.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2127a99f996fa5b8cfeb493366c83381/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_23_31_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/baffd72139904b265e04b37fc66ad106/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_13_23_31_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>黃開基拍賣行發言人表示，觀塘冠天閣中低層A室，面積約395方呎，屬2房戶型，今年7月一度開價350萬元推拍，現減價12萬元至338萬元再推拍，對比銀行最新估價420萬元低82萬元或約20%，呎價約8,557元，將於本周三（7日）推拍，同場共約12項物業可供競投。</p>\n<p>相關文章：</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T06:58:03.490199+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":554,"images":17,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}